      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i like the focus on his leadership. can you expand on the idea that the grain shortages and the class struggle were actually just secondary things that he used or managed, rather than being the real cause of the violence? like, argue that without his specific vision, the revolution would have just fizzled out or been much more moderate?",
